[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    104[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `bad()` in-range conversion, truncation toward zero, 2^31 boundary | `bad_in_range_and_boundary_conversions` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    105[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | `strtod` signs, whitespace, decimal and exponent forms | `atof_accepts_signs_whitespace_and_forms` |
